WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.088
Step 5 is the morning read.

2
00:00:02.088 --> 00:00:04.576
Telemetry completeness comes first,

3
00:00:04.576 --> 00:00:08.350
because a dark source makes
every tab over it unreliable.

4
00:00:08.350 --> 00:00:12.607
Then each tab in turn: each
row that needs work becomes,

5
00:00:12.607 --> 00:00:15.412
or is matched to, a task with an owner.

6
00:00:15.412 --> 00:00:19.312
Entra Health and the I T S M
queue are worked where they live.

7
00:00:19.312 --> 00:00:24.299
The workbook never closes a task, pages
anyone, or proves a check happened.

8
00:00:24.299 --> 00:00:29.298
Step 6 keeps the evidence: the kit
records the validation, preflight, plan,

9
00:00:29.298 --> 00:00:34.462
deployment, reachability check and
rollback plan, each hashed and chained.

10
00:00:34.462 --> 00:00:36.737
A rendered view is never recorded.

11
00:00:36.737 --> 00:00:39.290
And a portal edit comes back as an export,

12
00:00:39.290 --> 00:00:42.910
is validated, and replaces
the template through review.
